        <description>&lt;p&gt;You land on Spire: the crossbar is the app&amp;#x27;s map.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**The crossbar**: the front page now reads Spire · System · Federation · Endpoints · Applications · Models, and the app lands on Spire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**The Spire home**: cards that map to the crossbar — the System card (with the desktop-computer symbol) shows this machine&amp;#x27;s live CPU, RAM, DISK and uptime in stat tiles; Federation, Endpoints, Applications, and Models cards each summarize their surface. Clicking a card goes where its tab goes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**The System tab**: the machine the application is on — CPU, RAM, Thermal, Disk, and uptime, live, from the system&amp;#x27;s own counters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;**The Models tab**: Place a Model and what&amp;#x27;s placed, as its own door.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item>
